-        value.get("pass") is True
+        isinstance(value, dict) and value.get("pass")
         for key, value in report.items()
         if key.startswith("G")
     )

codex
The bare oracle solved all three easy instances by finding the quadratic relation, so the ladder correctly escalated. Medium is also being tested now; this is useful evidence that the small presets are genuinely hand/LLM accessible rather than merely large-answer traps.
